---
layout: base.njk
title: Courses & offers
description: Official technology learning resources and clearly disclosed, verified course offers. Find your next learning step.
nav: learning
permalink: /learning/
---
<div class="container page-body"><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">INVEST IN THE WAY YOU THINK</p><h1>Find your next<br><em>learning step.</em></h1><p>Useful places to learn cloud, Kubernetes, and DevOps. Choose the skill first. Let the discount come second.</p></header><div class="notice">These are links to external learning providers, not an on-site shop. Availability, pricing, and terms are set by each provider. Affiliate links and paid placements, when present, are clearly labelled. <a href="/disclosure/">Read the disclosure →</a></div>
<section aria-labelledby="resources-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOOD PLACES TO START</p><h2 id="resources-heading">Go straight to the source.</h2></div></div><p>Official resources to explore—not discount claims or paid endorsements.</p><div class="resource-grid">{% for provider in learning %}<article class="resource-card"><span class="provider-mark {{ provider.color }}" aria-hidden="true">{{ provider.mark }}</span><span class="eyebrow">{{ provider.topic | upper }}</span><h3>{{ provider.name }}</h3><p>{{ provider.description }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ provider.url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the provider <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="offers-section" aria-labelledby="offers-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORTH A LOOK, WHEN THE TIMING IS RIGHT</p><h2 id="offers-heading">Verified course offers.</h2></div></div><p>We only list an offer after checking its destination, terms, and expiry. Always confirm the final price with the provider.</p>
{% for offer in liveOffers %}<article class="offer-card" data-expires="{{ offer.expiresAt }}"><span class="offer-badge">{{ offer.offer }}</span><h3>{{ offer.title }}</h3><p>{{ offer.provider }} · {{ offer.description }}</p><p class="offer-meta">Checked {{ offer.verifiedAt | dateLabel }} · Valid until <time datetime="{{ offer.expiresAt }}">{{ offer.expiresAt }}</time></p>{% if offer.affiliate or offer.sponsored %}<p class="offer-disclosure">{% if offer.sponsored %}Sponsored placement. {% endif %}{% if offer.affiliate %}Affiliate link: we may earn a commission if you buy through this link.{% endif %} <a href="/disclosure/">How this works</a></p>{% endif %}{% if offer.terms %}<p class="offer-meta">{{ offer.terms }}</p>{% endif %}<div class="offer-actions">{% if offer.code %}<code class="coupon">{{ offer.code }}</code><button type="button" class="button button-light" data-copy-code="{{ offer.code }}" hidden>Copy code</button>{% endif %}<a class="button button-dark" href="{{ offer.url }}" rel="{% if offer.affiliate or offer.sponsored %}sponsored nofollow {% endif %}noopener noreferrer">View offer at {{ offer.provider }} ↗</a></div></article>{% endfor %}
<div class="empty-state" id="offers-empty" {% if liveOffers.length %}hidden{% endif %}><h3>No active discount codes right now.</h3><p>We would rather leave this space empty than send you to an expired or unverified deal. The official learning resources above are available to explore in the meantime.</p></div><p class="offer-meta">Last site build: {{ buildDate | dateLabel }}. Listed expiry times include their timezone; a provider can withdraw an offer earlier.</p></section>
<section class="closing-note"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUY ANOTHER COURSE</p><h2>What do you want to<br><em>be able to build?</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/blog/choose-a-course-with-a-project/">A simple way to choose your next course ↗</a></section></div>
